unts = { -- list of all alt account names that will be farmed for the main account\n   \"AltAccountNameHere\";\n   \"AltAccountNameHere\";\n   \"YouCanAddMore\";\n   \"YouCanAlsoRemoveSome\";\n}\n\n-- PLEASE READ THE ABOVE OPTIONS AND CHANGE IT TO UR LIKING\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://projecthook.xyz/scripts/autofarm.lua\"))()","features":"8 accounts = 120k credits per round\nThe amount you gain can be scaled by the amount of alts you use.\n\nThe basics on how it works: Main account consistently kills alt accounts that instantly teleport to the main account in secluded area that normal players can't access. You can add as many alts as you want, meaning the gain only increases. It also supports both maps and round endings.\n\nAlso provides a few features like optimization, (automatically limiting fps and quality) as well as quality of life features like an anti afk (ofc ofc) and auto disable in game sound.\n\nHow to use: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E13sz0DUxtA\n\nQuick FAQ:\nWhy is my main not hitting them? Equip baton! Should be auto equipping, will fix any issues with that once i wake up.\n\nIt's not working with (krnl, fluxus, etc)? I've successfully used it on some of the free executors, however I cannot guarantee successful execution on all. If you want 100% use synapse.\n\nDiscord for script support: https://projecthook.xyz/discord\n\nCredits to Y1K#0001 / SpiritXmas on v3rmillion\nOriginal thread: https://v3rmillion.net/showthread.php?tid=1176703","tags":["auto farm","auto","farm","cw","combat"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6208f07d8b3671e7d680afb1","username":"Seby","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bcbc945aa298bae87949a96b184f4b6490cedca1e495e86f902defe65f133d7f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6208f07d8b3671e7d680afb1-1720108824846.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6208f07d8b3671e7d680afb1","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/